+# Async Runtime
+
+The project's async runtime is tokio. This decision was recorded as a change from the earlier selection of async-std, made on the basis that tokio offers a more mature and comprehensive ecosystem with better tooling, libraries, and community support for integration across Rust async libraries and frameworks.
